Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:08.60,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:07.79,Default,,0,0,900,,Angels and demons were circling over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.79,0:00:13.50,Default,,0,0,900,,Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.20,0:00:19.17,Default,,0,0,900,,He who does not perceive his calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:25.58,Default,,0,0,900,,does not know true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.18,0:00:31.38,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.95,0:00:37.12,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.72,0:00:42.93,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.13,0:00:48.33,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.43,0:01:00.68,Default,,0,0,900,,I am calling, calling now.\NSpirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.15,0:01:06.15,Default,,0,0,900,,To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.42,0:01:12.46,Default,,0,0,900,,Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.49,0:01:17.96,Default,,0,0,900,,in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.43,0:01:23.93,Default,,0,0,900,,To stay myself longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.93,0:01:29.34,Default,,0,0,900,,The flow may swallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.14,0:01:35.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Dona dona dona... Dona...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.65,0:01:41.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Taking the calf to market...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.24,0:01:46.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Dona dona dona... Dona...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.04,0:01:51.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The cart sways...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.33,0:01:53.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh! Batou-San!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.05,0:01:58.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You guys... Do you understand\Nthe meaning of that song?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.26,0:02:01.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, please! Of course we do!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.13,0:02:03.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's a song describing how a\Ncalf gets sold to the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.85,0:02:06.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, in order preserve his existence,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:10.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,man prioritizes economic factors over\Nsentiments, that's what it means!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.94,0:02:14.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Right, right! It's about friendship\Nbeing defeated by poverty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.65,0:02:15.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.65,0:02:21.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well... It seems that we're\Nbeing sent off to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.03,0:02:24.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right then,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.16,0:02:27.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:37.77,Default,,320,0,400,,Chinks \N in the \N Armour \N of the\N Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.63,0:02:43.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.85,0:02:53.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The arrangements for your departure have\Nbeen completed. This is in regards to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.14,0:02:56.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the request for infiltration and investigation by\Nthe Prefecture Police's Public Safety division.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.74,0:03:04.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, this is my new personal history, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.57,0:03:09.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Make contact with Pavlo Zaitsov, who is\Nunder surveillance for suspected espionage,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.24,0:03:13.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,determine who abetted him in\Nespionage, and arrest them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:18.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Furthermore, eighteen minutes ago, there was a message\Nfrom the Chief, who is attending the international
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:24.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Conference on Countering Global Terrorism, requesting that you\Nresolve the situation by the time he returns from Britain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.18,0:03:33.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.68,0:03:34.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.69,0:03:37.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you concerned that the\NTachikomas were sent to the lab?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.36,0:03:38.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why would I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.98,0:03:40.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, it's fine if you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.86,0:03:43.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wouldn't want you to\Nworry yourself over me, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.86,0:03:48.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, I'm not "worried",\Nbut you sure don't seem too enthused lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.16,0:03:49.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh? Not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.87,0:03:54.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was a big fan of this Zaitsov dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.66,0:03:55.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Fan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:04.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In any case, make sure you return this car\Nto Section 9 after I get into the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.26,0:04:08.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I know. I would never dream of\Ndriving this antique around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:24.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Keep it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.53,0:04:25.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.53,0:04:26.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Keep coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.45,0:04:26.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.28,0:04:29.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Put more power in your punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.66,0:04:31.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.54,0:04:34.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Have you been listening to me at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.54,0:04:37.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry, but I didn't hear anything worth believing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.25,0:04:38.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:42.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right, if you doubt me that\Nmuch, give me your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.13,0:04:44.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.13,0:04:47.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Give to him, it's what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.01,0:04:55.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right, come get some.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.44,0:04:58.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.07,0:05:08.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, what's this? So, you're all talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.36,0:05:13.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A concussion? Lame ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.95,0:05:17.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's wrong? Aren't you guys pissed\Nthat one of you got taken down?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:19.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Try to get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.67,0:05:21.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Come on, who wants some?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.17,0:05:23.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nobody wants to challenge me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.34,0:05:24.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Cowards!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.05,0:05:26.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll take you on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.84,0:05:34.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're not new around here, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.23,0:05:45.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right then. I was thinking of\Nskipping a boring group training session,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.03,0:05:51.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but I heard that you've recently been assigned as a\Nfighting instructor, so I figured I'd actually show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.82,0:05:54.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't disappoint me, Mr. Silver Medal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.62,0:05:57.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You have a good memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.91,0:06:00.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, How about it? Want to go with boxing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.30,0:06:14.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're good. You've studied\Nmy style already, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.32,0:06:32.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, your fists still have some life left.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.22,0:06:55.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.73,0:07:08.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.70,0:07:14.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.70,0:07:16.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I took advantage of your implant's weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.12,0:07:19.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I thought I'd be able to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.91,0:07:21.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.50,0:07:25.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you really want to know why you\Nlost, come to my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.71,0:07:27.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll explain everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:40.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've been teaching my skills,\Nmoving from base to base.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.31,0:07:43.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Those are all that I have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.68,0:07:47.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hmm? You have a lot of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.10,0:07:52.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You've fought in this many tournaments,\Nand you've won practically all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.90,0:07:55.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's the only one that I didn't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.41,0:08:01.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I watched this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.79,0:08:09.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was shocked... I didn't think you were\Ngoing to lose, not even for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.21,0:08:12.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Heh, I was shocked, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.09,0:08:18.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Because of that one loss, everything went bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.30,0:08:23.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The media that idolized me and the\Nimplant manufacturers all went away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.43,0:08:29.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In that match... Why didn't you take\Nadvantage of the implant's weaknesses?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.52,0:08:33.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even now, I'm still not satisfied\Nwith that match's outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.24,0:08:36.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The implant's weaknesses, eh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.95,0:08:39.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, "the implant's weaknesses."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.24,0:08:41.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's what happened this afternoon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.53,0:08:44.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.04,0:08:46.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.96,0:08:50.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To tell you the truth, there's a trick to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.25,0:08:53.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Looks like the conversation\Nis pretty lively this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.76,0:08:56.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.84,0:08:59.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's the topic?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.93,0:09:01.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Can I join in?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.10,0:09:08.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, don't tell me you're serving that to a guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.69,0:09:10.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't we have more expensive liquor?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.77,0:09:14.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh? Price isn't everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.40,0:09:16.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In hospitality, it's the thought that counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.78,0:09:19.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You don't get it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.78,0:09:25.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, let's go out for drinks.\NThere's a place that serves really good liquor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.08,0:09:29.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's wrong? I don't mind this at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.71,0:09:32.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't say that. It'll be on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.42,0:09:40.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry, that's an urgent call.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.30,0:09:42.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.22,0:09:52.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry, he was in a good mood today for\Nonce, so I thought we'd have some medovukha...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.02,0:09:54.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I think I made him upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:55.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"Medovukha"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.07,0:10:01.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's home-brew liquor that's made in our homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.95,0:10:03.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder if you'll like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.16,0:10:11.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Whoa, it tastes sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.25,0:10:17.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Of course. It's made by fermenting honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.17,0:10:21.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You seem like a very good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.55,0:10:22.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you married?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.76,0:10:26.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, yeah. I have one kid.\NHe's going to be six years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.56,0:10:29.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Really? You don't look the type.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.85,0:10:34.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry, but something came up.\NLet's go drinking some other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.86,0:10:36.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We can continue the discussion then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.94,0:10:39.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, okay. Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.95,0:10:42.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please come by again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.57,0:10:45.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sure. I'll stop by soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.66,0:10:46.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.08,0:10:48.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,'Night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.58,0:10:56.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry about making you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.79,0:10:57.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,My guest went home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.88,0:11:00.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right, we'll send you\Nthe next set of instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.19,0:12:01.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.86,0:12:07.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, is Batou around?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.24,0:12:10.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou? Oh, that guy from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.37,0:12:11.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I haven't seen him around, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.37,0:12:15.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, the man's well-known around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.75,0:12:21.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, no. I think he's a member of the 103rd Air Force Division\Nthat came in when the Mikumo made a port call yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.34,0:12:23.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What do you want with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.84,0:12:25.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, so you are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.84,0:12:27.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How about lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.84,0:12:31.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Lunch? I feel more like a shower right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.77,0:12:36.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see. Well, guess I'll go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.85,0:12:41.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Taking boxing gloves to lunch?\NDon't disappoint me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.72,0:13:07.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.72,0:13:10.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.43,0:13:16.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Here's the autograph... I thought this\Nwould be better than signing a piece of paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.93,0:13:19.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thanks! My nephew will be pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.94,0:13:20.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.94,0:13:25.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, some good coffee beans came in.\NLet me brew you a cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.82,0:13:28.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't trouble yourself. I have to go back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.53,0:13:30.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll brew it quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.91,0:13:34.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Would it be better if the\Nbeans are coarsely ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.70,0:13:38.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, you have a metal mesh filter, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.62,0:13:40.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay, then yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.21,0:13:45.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.76,0:13:50.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.22,0:13:57.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Mmm, a Sagawa-made\Ndecoy firewall, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.85,0:13:59.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Using high-end stuff, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.48,0:14:08.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,By the way, there are some guys from somewhere who're\Nhere for a group training session, aren't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.90,0:14:12.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, are you referring to the Marines from\Nthe aircraft carrier that made a port call?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.20,0:14:16.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, maybe. Yesterday,\None of those guys came to the gym,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.20,0:14:18.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and he had some backbone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.29,0:14:19.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.41,0:14:21.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah. He has some real potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.50,0:14:23.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's nice. Do you think\Nyou will become good friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.79,0:14:29.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder... I'm not too good about making friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.88,0:14:33.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A double-layer firewall... Pretty damn cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.89,0:14:38.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder if the setup's to initially transfer\Nthe data here and then to send it outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.89,0:14:41.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Where does he intend to redirect it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.15,0:14:46.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.40,0:14:48.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is someone tapping my connection?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.28,0:14:52.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Damn it, I only have a little bit left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.29,0:15:01.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.08,0:15:05.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry, I just remembered\Nthat I have an urgent errand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.42,0:15:14.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, now... Taking our sweet\Ntime to transfer data, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.59,0:15:17.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And you call yourself a spy? Slowpoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.48,0:15:25.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now, where are you going to redirect the data?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.40,0:15:29.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.03,0:15:36.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did one of you enter my room?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.62,0:15:39.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No one's... inside, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.23,0:16:08.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Where are the "beans"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.81,0:16:09.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They are ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.02,0:16:11.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then, why aren't you starting the brew?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.32,0:16:14.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It seemed as though someone\Nwas tapping my connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.90,0:16:17.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To be safe, do not use that brewer again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.03,0:16:20.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's highly possible that it's now tainted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.12,0:16:22.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes. I'll make the brew elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.41,0:16:24.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll put the current brew in a pot and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.12,0:16:26.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will tell you the delivery\Nlocation at a later time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.42,0:16:29.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you see an unfamiliar face\Nin your vicinity, be cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.42,0:16:36.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,An unfamiliar face...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.81,0:16:51.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, Batou. Tonight the tab's\Ngoing to be on me for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.90,0:16:53.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Come with me for a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.03,0:16:55.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There won't be any sweet liquor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.49,0:17:03.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A good place, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.08,0:17:06.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ever since I came to work here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.58,0:17:10.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I haven't met any people worth my time, so I've\Nbasically been hanging out here all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.00,0:17:12.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.46,0:17:14.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's the first time that you've ordered this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.96,0:17:17.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, it seems like I've\Nfinally found a friend, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.97,0:17:19.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.43,0:17:27.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh yeah, you said you were married.\NYou must at least have a picture of your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.06,0:17:29.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Show it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.06,0:17:31.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm not that type of guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.15,0:17:36.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oops, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.07,0:17:38.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's expensive liquor, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.86,0:17:39.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.07,0:17:42.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry, can you go get something to wipe this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.08,0:17:43.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.30,0:17:58.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"Not that type", eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.22,0:18:02.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're hard to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.72,0:18:04.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll bring it to you right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.30,0:18:05.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.52,0:18:10.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He said he'll bring something later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.23,0:18:12.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.94,0:18:18.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Another call...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.03,0:18:21.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry, can you sit tight for a wh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.11,0:18:22.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.12,0:18:26.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Looks like you're as busy as one\Nof those intelligence people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.35,0:18:50.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Where is the coffee pot?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.64,0:18:51.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I brought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.94,0:18:57.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Getting chilly, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.57,0:19:04.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.66,0:19:05.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.57,0:19:08.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You just got a row of numbers!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.45,0:19:12.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wait a minute, I just followed your\Ninstructions to the letter and got data.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.08,0:19:15.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's an error on your part that\Nthe data wasn't what you wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:17.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You disappoint me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.17,0:19:19.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't blame me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.05,0:19:21.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Pay me what you owe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.76,0:19:23.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.26,0:19:24.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.18,0:19:26.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You were followed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.27,0:19:35.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're... intelligence?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.35,0:19:37.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, Internal Affairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.69,0:19:41.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You pretended you were a fan and approached me because\Nyou were conducting an internal investigation?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.15,0:19:44.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was deceived pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.36,0:19:46.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you study my past, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.16,0:19:49.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You wanted money?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.79,0:19:54.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even though you said everything went wrong,\Nit seems like you had a pretty good life going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.96,0:19:56.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What do {\i1}you{\i} know about my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.25,0:19:59.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I want to ask you one thing before I arrest you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.96,0:20:02.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's that "implant's weaknesses" thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.46,0:20:04.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Heh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.38,0:20:06.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I guess I haven't told you yet, have I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.05,0:20:08.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Come get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.55,0:20:11.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you can beat me again by taking\Nadvantage of these "weaknesses".
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.77,0:20:12.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.18,0:20:17.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you joking? You'll never be able to beat\Nme, no matter how many times you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.35,0:20:19.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then hurry up and come down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.03,0:20:26.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You'll regret that you put your gun away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.32,0:20:29.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Enough with the chitchat, come get some!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.71,0:20:38.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Your implants can't beat mine in terms of output!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.78,0:21:09.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You... did you let yourself be\Nbeaten on purpose yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.49,0:21:13.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Have you fallen so far that\Nyou can't even tell if I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.79,0:21:16.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.66,0:21:24.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The one with a weakness in his heart... was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.99,0:21:51.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.78,0:21:53.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm glad I ran into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.58,0:21:55.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Aren't you with my husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.29,0:21:58.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, not anymore...\NI was with him for a while, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.79,0:22:02.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see, then we've run into each\Nother at just the right time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.38,0:22:05.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Here, it might not suit your\Ntastes, but this is for your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.02,0:22:20.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, hey man... It's finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.81,0:22:21.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.10,0:22:27.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Er, what's wrong? You don't seem to be feeling any\Nbetter than before, even though the case was resolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.90,0:22:29.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do I seem that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.32,0:22:30.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.28,0:22:35.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,H-hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.66,0:22:41.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.26,0:22:53.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Dammit...!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.66,0:23:19.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's so cold and human
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.54,0:23:23.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's something humans do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.54,0:23:27.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She stays so cold in her soul, she's so number 9
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.84,0:23:30.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.84,0:23:35.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.30,0:23:39.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And is she really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.72,0:23:42.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She says there's something new
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.60,0:23:47.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But wake a lithium flower, just about to bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.73,0:23:50.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I smell lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.44,0:23:55.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Smelling lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.82,0:24:00.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.03,0:24:00.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.74,0:24:03.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.12,0:24:05.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.71,0:24:07.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is she when she doesn't suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.71,0:24:10.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder what she does when she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.21,0:24:14.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When she wakes up
